000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. PRICECAL.
000030*  Applies the volume discount to an order total.
000040 DATA DIVISION.
000050 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000060 01  WS-DISCOUNT             PIC V99 VALUE .05.
000070 LINKAGE SECTION.
000080 01  LK-ORDER-ID             PIC X(10).
000090 01  LK-TOTAL                PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
000100 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-ORDER-ID LK-TOTAL.
000110 MAIN-PARA.
000120     IF LK-TOTAL > 5000
000130        COMPUTE LK-TOTAL = LK-TOTAL * (1 - WS-DISCOUNT)
000140     END-IF.
